### Create Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-004",
  "name": "MacBook Pro",
  "description": "14-inch laptop",
  "price": -1499.99,
  "quantity": 5
}

### Update Product
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/4f87ef0e-5230-414d-8122-b0027675de91
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Macbook Air",
  "status": "DISCONTINUED"
}


### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/2d05785c-fd0b-479e-a565-47d5a534bad2
